{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every stub-verb line a game still answers in the engine’s voice, by property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"name.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoTestSupport"}],"externalID":"s:17GnustoTestSupport21engineVoicedStubLines2inSaySSG0A08GameTextV0F7RepliesV_tF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"engineVoicedStubLines","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"StubReplies","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV11StubRepliesV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"role":"symbol","title":"engineVoicedStubLines(in:)","roleHeading":"Function","symbolKind":"func"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustotestsupport\/enginevoicedstublines(in:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectInOrder(_:_:sourceLocation:)","doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectEveryNounAnswered(_:_:sourceLocation:)","doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectNoAmbiguity(_:_:sourceLocation:)","doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectNoEngineStubLineSurvives(in:game:sourceLocation:)"],"title":"Asserting","anchor":"Asserting","generated":true}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/engineVoicedStubLines(in:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"engineVoicedStubLines"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"in"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"ours","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"StubReplies","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV11StubRepliesV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/StubReplies","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"text.stubs"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"ours"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The property names still identical to the engine’s wording."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A game that gives itself a "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"stub floor","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"text.stubs"},{"type":"text","text":", rather than an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"action(…)"},{"type":"text","text":" row per verb — is claiming all ~47 of them, and the claim is easy"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to half-keep: one line left unassigned means a plain modern narrator takes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"over on the turn after a re-voiced one, which is exactly the defect the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Dungeon and Zork 1 floors were written to close. Naming each verb in a test"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catches that; it does not catch a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"forty-eighth"}]},{"type":"text","text":" stub arriving in the engine"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tomorrow, which would slip past every named assertion at once."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"So this reads the properties off "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameText.StubReplies"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mirror"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than listing them: every line the engine actually ships is compared,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and one added tomorrow is compared the day it lands. A property whose type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this cannot render is reported as its own issue rather than skipped, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what keeps “reflected” from quietly meaning “unchecked”."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That last sentence has no exception to it as of #246. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"give"},{"text":" used to be one:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the one line about two objects, so not a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameText.Line"},{"text":", so unreachable by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reflection and compared by hand below the loop — the single line in here that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"could change shape without the sweep noticing. It takes a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameText.Gift"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now, and goes through the same door as the other forty-eight.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which sentences each line prints is the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"subject’s"}]},{"type":"text","text":" business as of #255:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LineSubject.samples(one:many:)"},{"type":"text","text":" supplies them, so a subject arriving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tomorrow is swept the day it lands rather than after somebody teaches a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"switch here about it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It is split out from ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoTestSupport\/documentation\/GnustoTestSupport\/expectNoEngineStubLineSurvives(in:game:sourceLocation:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the sweep can be tested for being ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"alive"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":": a reflection loop that matches"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"nothing passes silently, where one asserted to see all forty-nine lines"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"cannot."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoTestSupport/documentation/GnustoTestSupport/expectNoAmbiguity(_:_:sourceLocation:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustotestsupport\/expectnoambiguity(_:_:sourcelocation:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a Swift Testing issue if the transcript contains a disambiguation"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"question — ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Which do you mean: the narrow chimney or the small door?”"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"expectNoAmbiguity"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"tex